     1	// The Work board's marks, drawn. One SVG that scales to its container; every shape here
     2	// is named in the identity's mark table ([docs/visual-identity.md](docs/visual-identity.md)),
     3	// and the decisions behind them were all made in [`board.mjs`](board.mjs).
     4	//
